  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your bond with the land is a sacred thing.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Spirit of the Wild<sup>ARG</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You gain a +4 bonus on all Perception checks made in your chosen terrain, not only in surprise rounds, and you can always act in any surprise round while in that terrain. If you expend one use of mythic power at the beginning of a battle, whether or not there is a surprise round, you gain blindsense 30 feet for a number of rounds equal to your mythic tier.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-n-s-feats#toc79\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
